# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# Sarvam AI speech-to-text key, from https://dashboard.sarvam.ai.
# Used as the default when no key has been entered in Settings; a key typed
# in Settings takes precedence over this one.
#
# Note: .env is bundled into the APK as an asset, so anyone with the APK can
# read this value. Fine for a personal build; don't ship it publicly.
SARVAM_API_KEY=
